WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Initial images from Bridge, RoboMIND, and DROID.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Robot renderings are overlaid on the initial images.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.500
The rendering overlay clears.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Future frames predicted by Doppel.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.500
The three examples expand into nine examples.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.750
Initial observations, then robot rendering overlays, then the overlays clear.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.500
Predicted frames for nine examples.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.500
The nine examples expand into eighty-one examples.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.750
Robot renderings over the initial images from DROID, RoboMIND, and Bridge.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.250
Predicted videos on DROID, RoboMIND, and Bridge.
